<h1>📱 B2B High-Ticket Lead Alert Business: Master Plan & Setup Guide</h1>
<p><b>Target Goal:</b> $10,000 / month recurring revenue (100–125 members @ $79–$99/month)  </p>
<p><b>Time Commitment:</b> 10–15 minutes daily from your phone  </p>
<p><b>Startup Cost:</b> $0 upfront (open data feeds, free cloud tier, no-risk revenue share)</p>
<hr style="border:0; border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1; margin:20px 0;">
